                "html": "<section class=\"sec-editorial bg-img-pricing text-center\">\n    <div class=\"overlay-layer overlay-warm-amber\"></div>\n    <div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width: 900px;\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow-badge\">SECTION 37</div>\n      <h2 class=\"sec-title\">The window is open — and the slop is clearing it for you.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--ink-body); line-height: 1.8;\">\n        As Amazon flags low-quality AI books, sellers pushing junk are getting squeezed out — leaving more room for people publishing <em>real</em>, compliant books. Early movers who build clean catalogs now earn royalties for years. Waiting means competing with everyone who read this first.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </section>",
